  - m_Id: 13230217895936
    m_Localized: 'Allows the player to jump.

      

      

      Key : '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13097220710400
    m_Localized: Jump
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13153520852992
    m_Localized: Double Jump
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13552575324160
    m_Localized: 'Allows the player to jump a second time while in the air.

      

      

      Key
      :'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15318368919552
    m_Localized: 'Allows the player to perform a brief vertical jump, only while
      on the ground.

      

      

      Key :'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15716949434368
    m_Localized: "This move allows you to send the ball directly above your blop
      at moderate speed. It also increases your special move gauge by 1.\r\nTo perform
      it, press \u201CX\u201D just before hitting the ball while standing still.\r\n\r\nKey
      :"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16117945868288
    m_Localized: Absorption
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16178268348416
    m_Localized: Throw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16326159507456
    m_Localized: "Allows you to catch the ball and keep it inside the blob. Press
      and hold \u201CX\u201D to catch the ball and keep it inside the blob.\r\n\r\nKey
      :"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16361991446528
    m_Localized: 'Allows you to shoot the ball if you have previously caught it.

      

      

      Key
      :'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17124264255488
    m_Localized: "\r\n   - Points: \r\n\r\nTo score a point, the ball must touch
      the ground on the opponent's side.\r\n\r\n\r\n   - Fouls : These result in
      a point for the opponent\r\n\r\n \u2022 Touching the ball three times in a
      row without the opponent touching it\r\n \u2022 Touching the ground with the
      ball in your possession\r\n \u2022 Stepping into the opponent's court"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17592579268608
    m_Localized: "Special moves are unlocked after three Perfect Receives.\r\n\r\nTo
      activate it, simply press \u201CB\u201D when the ball is on your side of the
      court to slow it down, then jump to catch it. If the ball hits the ground,
      the special move is lost.\r\n\r\nOnce the ball is caught, simply press \u201CB\u201D
      again to shoot using your blop's special move.\r\n\r\n\r\n                                                                                                                              
      Key :"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18466076631040
    m_Localized: "\r\nBlep is agile!\r\n\r\nHe can change the ball's trajectory after
      it's been hit!\r\n\r\nPress \u201CB\u201D after hitting the ball to change
      its trajectory and smash it into the ground."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18807144849408
    m_Localized: "\r\nBlop is quite the magician!\r\n\r\nHe can pull out three balloons,
      two of which will be fake.\r\n\r\nPress \u201CB\u201D three times to pull out
      the three balloons."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19114209845248
    m_Localized: '

      Blup is a renowned magician.

      

      Once the
      ball is kicked, it shrinks, making it harder to catch. The ball returns to
      its normal size upon first contact with an opposing player or the ground.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19408729677824
    m_Localized: '

      Blap is as fast as lightning

      

      He fires
      a bullet so fast that it becomes invisible, leaving only an electric trail
      in its wake.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
